**Policy (strengthened 2026-05-15):** This file holds forward-looking PM directives for future iters — standing rules, scope decisions, "do X going forward", "stop doing Y", new conventions, contradictions to resolve. One H3 per directive.

This file is **not** a retrospective. It is **not** a place for "iter-N close — sprint X RALPH-converged + 5 tasks shipped" summaries, throughput tallies, ledger blocks, or what-shipped lists. All of that goes in `ralph/state/iter-changelog.md`.

